    "objective": "Hit all 3 targets (30 m, 45 m, then 18 m) within 10 launches. A landing within 1.5 m of the target centre counts as a hit, including exactly 1.5 m.",
    "hint": "At the same speed, angles that add up to 90° (like 30° and 60°) land at the same spot, and 45° goes farthest. Doubling the speed makes the shot go four times as far."
